:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T19:18:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T19:19:09Z","body":"@AdriaandeJongh \n\n> our project default 'always on top'\n\nWhen you say \"our project default 'always on top'\" what do you mean exactly? Just to be sure the adjustment will work with your workflow.\nYou are refering to this Project settings, right?\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17d3ca73-7239-4144-b3fe-35a1ad8052cd)\n\nAlso, to go back the the 4.3 behaviour where the \"Always on top\" is respected, I suggest for the time being you disable the embedding.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2704735856/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705160591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101984#issuecomment-2705160591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101984","id":2705160591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hPXmP","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T23:24:56Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T23:24:56Z","body":"I've found an easy solution for this. It seems to work as expected for me on windows.\n\n---\n> Effectively, the \"Always on Top\" could work probably be fixed for the floating window but not when directly in the editor.\n\nI think that was the intent all along, for it to work with the floating window.\nThe reason the floating window having the 'always on top' option work is important is so you can change the objects properties without it being minimized so you can see the changes.\n\nYou could argue that if one wants to do that, it'd be better to just use the fully embed version. \nAnd that is possibly true, but idk, even if it makes sense, I myself end up always using the floating embed window on top of Godot editor for some reason. I guess its habit at this point.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705160591/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":